{"id":"mahabharata-6-049","work":"mahabharata","part":6,"partName":"भीष्मपर्व","partNameEn":"Bhishma Parva","unit":49,"title":"एकोनपञ्चाशत्तमोऽध्यायः","titleEn":"Adhyaya 49 · Drona against Dhrishtadyumna","summary":{"en":"Dhritarashtra marvels that Bhishma could not overcome the Pandavas, and Sanjaya tells how Dhrishtadyumna stands firm against Drona's arrows. Drona turns to Virata and Drupada while Bhima attacks the Kalingas.","kn":"ಭೀಷ್ಮನೂ ಪಾಂಡವರನ್ನು ಗೆಲ್ಲಲಿಲ್ಲವೆಂದು ಧೃತರಾಷ್ಟ್ರ ಬೆರಗಾಗುತ್ತಾನೆ; ದ್ರೋಣನ ಬಾಣಗಳ ಎದುರು ಧೃಷ್ಟದ್ಯುಮ್ನ ಅಚಲನಾಗಿ ನಿಂತುದನ್ನು ಸಂಜಯ ಹೇಳುತ್ತಾನೆ. ದ್ರೋಣ ವಿರಾಟ, ದ್ರುಪದರ ಕಡೆ ತಿರುಗುತ್ತಾನೆ, ಭೀಮ ಕಳಿಂಗರ ಮೇಲೆ ಎರಗುತ್ತಾನೆ.","hi":"धृतराष्ट्र चकित होते हैं कि भीष्म पाण्डवों को न जीत सके, और संजय बताते हैं कि धृष्टद्युम्न द्रोण के बाणों के सामने अटल रहा। द्रोण विराट और द्रुपद की ओर मुड़ते हैं और भीम कलिंगों पर टूट पड़ते हैं।","te":"భీష్ముడూ పాండవులను జయించలేకపోయాడని ధృతరాష్ట్రుడు ఆశ్చర్యపడతాడు; ద్రోణుని బాణాల ముందు ధృష్టద్యుమ్నుడు నిలిచిన తీరును సంజయుడు చెబుతాడు. ద్రోణుడు విరాట, ద్రుపదుల వైపు తిరుగుతాడు, భీముడు కళింగులపై పడతాడు.","ta":"பீஷ்மராலும் பாண்டவரை வெல்ல முடியவில்லையே என்று த்ருதராஷ்டிரன் வியக்கிறான்; த்ரோணரின் அம்புகள் முன் த்ருஷ்டத்யும்னன் அசையாது நின்றதைச் சஞ்சயன் கூறுகிறான். த்ரோணர் விராடன், துருபதனை நோக்கித் திரும்ப, பீமன் கலிங்கர் மீது பாய்கிறான்.","ml":"ഭീഷ്മരിന് പാണ്ഡവരെ കീഴടക്കാനാകാത്തതിൽ ധൃതരാഷ്ട്രർ വിസ്മയിക്കുന്നു. ദ്രോണരുടെ അമ്പുകളെ ധൃഷ്ടദ്യുമ്നൻ ഉറച്ചുനിന്ന് ചെറുക്കുന്നത് സഞ്ജയൻ പറയുന്നു. ദ്രോണർ വിരാടനെയും ദ്രുപദനെയും നേരിടുന്നു; ഭീമൻ കലിംഗരെ ആക്രമിക്കുന്നു."},"source":"Mahabharata, Critical Edition (BORI, Pune) 6.49; e-text by M. Tokunaga and J. D. Smith, © BORI 1999, version of Mon Jul 26 2021","sections":[{"title":"भीष्मवधपर्व","titleEn":"Bhishmavadha Parva (The fall of Bhishma)","verses":[{"text":"धृतराष्ट्र उवाच","meaning":{"en":"Dhritarashtra said:"}},{"n":1,"text":"कथं द्रोणो महेष्वासः पाञ्चाल्यश्चापि पार्षतः ।\nरणे समीयतुर्यत्तौ तन्ममाचक्ष्व संजय ॥","meaning":{"en":"Tell me, Sanjaya, how the great archer Drona and the Panchala prince Dhrishtadyumna, son of Prishata, met in battle, both intent."}},{"n":2,"text":"दिष्टमेव परं मन्ये पौरुषादपि संजय ।\nयत्र शांतनवो भीष्मो नातरद्युधि पाण्डवम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"I think fate is supreme, even above human effort, Sanjaya, since Bhishma, son of Shantanu, could not get past the Pandava in battle."}},{"n":3,"text":"भीष्मो हि समरे क्रुद्धो हन्याल्लोकांश्चराचरान् ।\nस कथं पाण्डवं युद्धे नातरत्संजयौजसा ॥","meaning":{"en":"For Bhishma, angered in battle, could kill the moving and unmoving worlds. How was he unable to overcome the Pandava in the fight, Sanjaya, with all his strength?"}},{"text":"संजय उवाच","meaning":{"en":"Sanjaya said:"}},{"n":4,"text":"शृणु राजन्स्थिरो भूत्वा युद्धमेतत्सुदारुणम् ।\nन शक्यः पाण्डवो जेतुं देवैरपि सवासवैः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Listen, king, and be steady, to this terrible battle. The Pandava cannot be conquered even by the gods with Indra."}},{"n":5,"text":"द्रोणस्तु निशितैर्बाणैर्धृष्टद्युम्नमयोधयत् ।\nसारथिं चास्य भल्लेन रथनीडादपातयत् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Drona fought Dhrishtadyumna with sharp arrows, and with a broad-headed arrow knocked his charioteer from the chariot-seat."}},{"n":6,"text":"तस्याथ चतुरो वाहांश्चतुर्भिः सायकोत्तमैः ।\nपीडयामास संक्रुद्धो धृष्टद्युम्नस्य मारिष ॥","meaning":{"en":"Then, in a fury, sir, he harassed Dhrishtadyumna's four horses with four excellent arrows."}},{"n":7,"text":"धृष्टद्युम्नस्ततो द्रोणं नवत्या निशितैः शरैः ।\nविव्याध प्रहसन्वीरस्तिष्ठ तिष्ठेति चाब्रवीत् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Dhrishtadyumna, the hero, then struck Drona with ninety sharp arrows, almost laughing, and said, \"Stand, stand!\""}},{"n":8,"text":"ततः पुनरमेयात्मा भारद्वाजः प्रतापवान् ।\nशरैः प्रच्छादयामास धृष्टद्युम्नममर्षणम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Then again the valiant, boundless Bharadvaja's son covered the furious Dhrishtadyumna with arrows."}},{"n":9,"text":"आददे च शरं घोरं पार्षतस्य वधं प्रति ।\nशक्राशनिसमस्पर्शं मृत्युदण्डमिवापरम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"And he took up a terrible arrow to kill Prishata's son, whose touch was like Indra's thunderbolt, like a second staff of Death."}},{"n":10,"text":"हाहाकारो महानासीत्सर्वसैन्यस्य भारत ।\nतमिषुं संधितं दृष्ट्वा भारद्वाजेन संयुगे ॥","meaning":{"en":"A great cry of dismay arose from the whole army, O Bharata, seeing that arrow fitted by Bharadvaja's son in the battle."}},{"n":11,"text":"तत्राद्भुतमपश्याम धृष्टद्युम्नस्य पौरुषम् ।\nयदेकः समरे वीरस्तस्थौ गिरिरिवाचलः ॥","meaning":{"en":"There we saw a wonder of Dhrishtadyumna's manliness, that he stood alone in the battle like an unmoving mountain."}},{"n":12,"text":"तं च दीप्तं शरं घोरमायान्तं मृत्युमात्मनः ।\nचिच्छेद शरवृष्टिं च भारद्वाजे मुमोच ह ॥","meaning":{"en":"He cut down that blazing, dreadful arrow, coming as his own death, and loosed a shower of arrows at Bharadvaja's son."}},{"n":13,"text":"तत उच्चुक्रुशुः सर्वे पाञ्चालाः पाण्डवैः सह ।\nधृष्टद्युम्नेन तत्कर्म कृतं दृष्ट्वा सुदुष्करम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Then all the Panchalas with the Pandavas roared, seeing that very hard deed done by Dhrishtadyumna."}},{"n":14,"text":"ततः शक्तिं महावेगां स्वर्णवैडूर्यभूषिताम् ।\nद्रोणस्य निधनाकाङ्क्षी चिक्षेप स पराक्रमी ॥","meaning":{"en":"Then the valiant one, wishing for Drona's death, hurled a very swift spear adorned with gold and cat's-eye gems."}},{"n":15,"text":"तामापतन्तीं सहसा शक्तिं कनकभूषणाम् ।\nत्रिधा चिक्षेप समरे भारद्वाजो हसन्निव ॥","meaning":{"en":"Seeing that spear adorned with gold coming suddenly, Bharadvaja's son, almost laughing, cut it into three pieces in the battle."}},{"n":16,"text":"शक्तिं विनिहतां दृष्ट्वा धृष्टद्युम्नः प्रतापवान् ।\nववर्ष शरवर्षाणि द्रोणं प्रति जनेश्वर ॥","meaning":{"en":"Seeing the spear shattered, the mighty Dhrishtadyumna, O lord of men, rained showers of arrows on Drona."}},{"n":17,"text":"शरवर्षं ततस्तं तु संनिवार्य महायशाः ।\nद्रोणो द्रुपदपुत्रस्य मध्ये चिच्छेद कार्मुकम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Then the greatly renowned Drona, checking that shower of arrows, cut the bow of Drupada's son in the middle."}},{"n":18,"text":"स च्छिन्नधन्वा समरे गदां गुर्वीं महायशाः ।\nद्रोणाय प्रेषयामास गिरिसारमयीं बली ॥","meaning":{"en":"With his bow cut, the mighty and famous one hurled a heavy mace, made of mountain-iron, at Drona."}},{"n":19,"text":"सा गदा वेगवन्मुक्ता प्रायाद्द्रोणजिघांसया ।\nतत्राद्भुतमपश्याम भारद्वाजस्य विक्रमम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Hurled with speed, that mace flew, intent on killing Drona. There we saw the prowess of Bharadvaja's son."}},{"n":20,"text":"लाघवाद्व्यंसयामास गदां हेमविभूषिताम् ।\nव्यंसयित्वा गदां तां च प्रेषयामास पार्षते ॥","meaning":{"en":"With his quickness he made the gold-adorned mace miss, and after making it miss, he sent arrows at Prishata's son."}},{"n":21,"text":"भल्लान्सुनिशितान्पीतान्स्वर्णपुङ्खाञ्शिलाशितान् ।\nते तस्य कवचं भित्त्वा पपुः शोणितमाहवे ॥","meaning":{"en":"They were very sharp, yellow-bright broad-headed arrows with golden feathers, whetted on stone; they pierced his armor and drank blood in the battle."}},{"n":22,"text":"अथान्यद्धनुरादाय धृष्टद्युम्नो महामनाः ।\nद्रोणं युधि पराक्रम्य शरैर्विव्याध पञ्चभिः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Then the great-minded Dhrishtadyumna took another bow and, valiantly in the battle, pierced Drona with five arrows."}},{"n":23,"text":"रुधिराक्तौ ततस्तौ तु शुशुभाते नरर्षभौ ।\nवसन्तसमये राजन्पुष्पिताविव किंशुकौ ॥","meaning":{"en":"Both bathed in blood, those two bulls among men shone, O king, like blooming kimshuka trees in spring."}},{"n":24,"text":"अमर्षितस्ततो राजन्पराक्रम्य चमूमुखे ।\nद्रोणो द्रुपदपुत्रस्य पुनश्चिच्छेद कार्मुकम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Then, O king, enraged, Drona showed his valor at the head of the army and cut the bow of Drupada's son again."}},{"n":25,"text":"अथैनं छिन्नधन्वानं शरैः संनतपर्वभिः ।\nअवाकिरदमेयात्मा वृष्ट्या मेघ इवाचलम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Then the boundless one covered him, now bowless, with straight-jointed arrows, as a cloud covers a mountain with rain."}},{"n":26,"text":"सारथिं चास्य भल्लेन रथनीडादपातयत् ।\nअथास्य चतुरो वाहांश्चतुर्भिर्निशितैः शरैः ॥","meaning":{"en":"With a broad-headed arrow he knocked the charioteer from the chariot-seat, and with four sharp arrows,"}},{"n":27,"text":"पातयामास समरे सिंहनादं ननाद च ।\nततोऽपरेण भल्लेन हस्ताच्चापमथाच्छिनत् ॥","meaning":{"en":"he felled his four horses in the battle and roared a lion's roar. Then with another broad-headed arrow he cut the bow from his hand."}},{"n":28,"text":"स च्छिन्नधन्वा विरथो हताश्वो हतसारथिः ।\nगदापाणिरवारोहत्ख्यापयन्पौरुषं महत् ॥","meaning":{"en":"With his bow cut, his chariot gone, his horses and charioteer dead, Dhrishtadyumna got down with a mace in hand, proclaiming his great manliness."}},{"n":29,"text":"तामस्य विशिखैस्तूर्णं पातयामास भारत ।\nरथादनवरूढस्य तदद्भुतमिवाभवत् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Drona quickly brought that mace down with arrows, O Bharata, though Dhrishtadyumna had not yet left the chariot; this seemed a wonder."}},{"n":30,"text":"ततः स विपुलं चर्म शतचन्द्रं च भानुमत् ।\nखड्गं च विपुलं दिव्यं प्रगृह्य सुभुजो बली ॥","meaning":{"en":"Then the mighty one with fine arms took up a great shield, bright with a hundred moons, and a great, bright, divine sword,"}},{"n":31,"text":"अभिदुद्राव वेगेन द्रोणस्य वधकाङ्क्षया ।\nआमिषार्थी यथा सिंहो वने मत्तमिव द्विपम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"and rushed swiftly at Drona, wishing to kill him, as a lion in a forest, seeking meat, rushes at a rutting elephant."}},{"n":32,"text":"तत्राद्भुतमपश्याम भारद्वाजस्य पौरुषम् ।\nलाघवं चास्त्रयोगं च बलं बाह्वोश्च भारत ॥","meaning":{"en":"There we saw the manliness of Bharadvaja's son, his quickness, his use of weapons and the strength of his arms, O Bharata,"}},{"n":33,"text":"यदेनं शरवर्षेण वारयामास पार्षतम् ।\nन शशाक ततो गन्तुं बलवानपि संयुगे ॥","meaning":{"en":"for he held Prishata's son back with a shower of arrows, so that, though strong, he could not advance in the battle."}},{"n":34,"text":"तत्र स्थितमपश्याम धृष्टद्युम्नं महारथम् ।\nवारयाणं शरौघांश्च चर्मणा कृतहस्तवत् ॥","meaning":{"en":"There we saw the great chariot-warrior Dhrishtadyumna standing, warding off floods of arrows with his shield, like a practiced man."}},{"n":35,"text":"ततो भीमो महाबाहुः सहसाभ्यपतद्बली ।\nसाहाय्यकारी समरे पार्षतस्य महात्मनः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Then mighty-armed and strong Bhima suddenly came up in the battle to help the great-souled son of Prishata."}},{"n":36,"text":"स द्रोणं निशितैर्बाणै राजन्विव्याध सप्तभिः ।\nपार्षतं च तदा तूर्णमन्यमारोपयद्रथम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"O king, he struck Drona with seven sharp arrows, and quickly set Prishata's son on another chariot."}},{"n":37,"text":"ततो दुर्योधनो राजा कलिङ्गं समचोदयत् ।\nसैन्येन महता युक्तं भारद्वाजस्य रक्षणे ॥","meaning":{"en":"Then King Duryodhana urged on the Kalinga king, with a large army, to protect Bharadvaja's son."}},{"n":38,"text":"ततः सा महती सेना कलिङ्गानां जनेश्वर ।\nभीममभ्युद्ययौ तूर्णं तव पुत्रस्य शासनात् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Then that great army of the Kalingas, O lord of men, quickly advanced against Bhima at your son's command."}},{"n":39,"text":"पाञ्चाल्यमभिसंत्यज्य द्रोणोऽपि रथिनां वरः ।\nविराटद्रुपदौ वृद्धौ योधयामास संगतौ ।\nधृष्टद्युम्नोऽपि समरे धर्मराजं समभ्ययात् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Leaving the Panchala prince, Drona, best of chariot-warriors, together fought the aged Virata and Drupada, while Dhrishtadyumna in the battle went to the king of dharma, Yudhishthira."}},{"n":40,"text":"ततः प्रववृते युद्धं तुमुलं लोमहर्षणम् ।\nकलिङ्गानां च समरे भीमस्य च महात्मनः ।\nजगतः प्रक्षयकरं घोररूपं भयानकम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Then a tumultuous, hair-raising battle began between the Kalingas and the great-souled Bhima, a terrible, fearful fight, destroying the world."}}]}]}